{"cells":[{"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{},"source":["# Q8 — Simulated Annealing\n","## Minimize \\(f(x)=x^2-6x+13\\)\n","\n","**Given:** initial \\(x=1\\), \\(T=10\\), cooling factor \\(\\alpha=0.5\\), \\(T_{min}=1\\), neighbour \\(x'=x+1\\), random numbers `0.30, 0.80, 0.20, 0.90`.\n","\n","Acceptance rule: \\(P=1\\) if \\(\\Delta f\\le0\\), otherwise \\(P=e^{-\\Delta f/T}\\)."]},{"cell_type":"code","execution_count":null,"metadata":{},"outputs":[],"source":["import math\n","import pandas as pd\n","\n","def f(x):\n","    return x**2 - 6*x + 13\n","\n","x = 1\n","T = 10\n","alpha = 0.5\n","random_numbers = [0.30, 0.80, 0.20, 0.90]\n","best_x, best_f = x, f(x)\n","records = []\n","\n","for iteration, r in enumerate(random_numbers, 1):\n","    current_x = x\n","    current_f = f(x)\n","    neighbour = x + 1\n","    neighbour_f = f(neighbour)\n","    delta_f = neighbour_f - current_f\n","\n","    if delta_f <= 0:\n","        P = 1.0\n","        decision = \"Accept\"\n","        x = neighbour\n","        r_used = None\n","    else:\n","        P = math.exp(-delta_f / T)\n","        r_used = r\n","        if r < P:\n","            decision = \"Accept\"\n","            x = neighbour\n","        else:\n","            decision = \"Reject\"\n","\n","    if f(x) < best_f:\n","        best_x, best_f = x, f(x)\n","\n","    records.append({\n","        \"Iteration\": iteration, \"T\": T, \"Current x\": current_x,\n","        \"Neighbour x'\": neighbour, \"f(x)\": current_f,\n","        \"f(x')\": neighbour_f, \"Delta f\": delta_f,\n","        \"P\": round(P, 4), \"Random r\": r_used,\n","        \"Decision\": decision, \"Best x\": best_x, \"Best f(x)\": best_f\n","    })\n","    T *= alpha\n","\n","pd.DataFrame(records)\n"]},{"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{},"source":["## Solution\n","\n","Iteration 1: \\(f(1)=8\\), \\(f(2)=5\\), so \\(\\Delta f=-3\\). Accept.\n","\n","Iteration 2: \\(f(2)=5\\), \\(f(3)=4\\), so \\(\\Delta f=-1\\). Accept.\n","\n","Iteration 3: \\(f(3)=4\\), \\(f(4)=5\\), so \\(\\Delta f=1\\). \\(P=e^{-1/2.5}=0.6703\\). Since \\(0.30<0.6703\\), accept; best remains \\(x=3\\).\n","\n","Iteration 4: \\(f(4)=5\\), \\(f(5)=8\\), so \\(\\Delta f=3\\). \\(P=e^{-3/1.25}=0.0907\\). Since \\(0.80>0.0907\\), reject.\n","\n","### Final answer\n","\\[\\boxed{x=3,\\quad f(x)=4}\\]\n","\n","Analytically, \\(f(x)=(x-3)^2+4\\), so the exact minimum is also \\(x=3,f(x)=4\\)."]}],"metadata":{"kernelspec":{"display_name":"Python 3","language":"python","name":"python3"},"nbformat":4,"nbformat_minor":5}